  "description": "Tamper-evident decision records for .NET AI. Append-only audit log of the AI decisions you instrument, written as CloudEvents 1.0 JSON (input/output hashes, detector results, human-oversight actions), plus Merkle-tree and Ed25519 signing primitives you call to seal batches of records with your own key, so anyone with the public key can verify a record was never altered. Ships in-memory and JSONL stores, retention policies with legal holds and signed deletion certificates, and an ASP.NET Core export endpoint. Runs in your process and makes no outbound network calls: no SaaS, no model downloads. Works with any LLM stack on .NET 8+; pairs naturally with Invarix.Guard.",
